      "normalizedSource": "```swift let x = 8.625 print(x / 0.75) // Prints \"11.5\" let q = (x / 0.75).rounded(.towardZero) // q == 11.0 let r = x.truncatingRemainder(dividingBy: 0.75) // r == 0.375 let x1 = 0.75 * q + r // x1 == 8.625 ```",
